    "teaching_notes": "Activate AFTER showing the symbols reference chart image. Start in Learn mode and guide the student through each symbol step: 'Step 2 shows the cell — notice the long line is positive. Step 3 shows the battery — it's just multiple cells joined.' After completing Learn mode, switch to Practice mode: 'Now let's see if you can identify them on your own!' The tool's built-in practice questions provide immediate feedback.",
    "instructions_for_student": "Learn all seven circuit symbols one by one in Learn mode — pay attention to which line is positive and which is negative! Then switch to Practice mode to test yourself with quiz questions. Can you identify every symbol correctly?"
